      "content": "It's true, words don't fix the exhaustion, and your self-perception is a very real, painful thing. But stopping being an issue is a very permanent solution to a temporary feeling. You are not just taking up space; you are a person who is hurting, and that pain is real enough to warrant attention. Instead of trying to erase yourself, maybe you could try to find one small thing that lets you breathe, even if it's just for a moment.",
