    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel temporary though. it feels like this is just how life is now. and i love them so much, that's why it hurts. i just want them to have a life that isn't defined by taking care of a broken version of me. wouldn't it be more selfless to let them move on and be happy without this constant shadow hanging over them? it feels like the most loving thing i could actually do is just step out of the way.",
